post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'

Synapse Dub installed.

1. Initialize only the Python projects missing from CachyOS:
     synapse-dub-runtime setup

2. Review licenses and configuration:
     /etc/synapse/dub/config.conf

3. As the desktop user, download the selected external model weights:
     synapse-dub-models --backend wav2lip --accept-noncommercial

4. Check the runtime:
     synapse-dub doctor

No model weight is included in this package. XTTS-v2 and the original Wav2Lip
weights are non-commercial. Model acceptance and voice enrollment must be done
in the user session, not from this pacman install hook.

MSG
}

post_upgrade() {
  post_install
}
